                <pb facs="0218" n="112" sameAs="frus:frus1906p1/pg112"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        President Penna.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1906-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November 16,
                        1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In behalf of President Roosevelt and in his name, interpreting his sentiments
                    toward the United States of Brazil and toward yourself personally, I send hearty
                    congratulation upon your inauguration as President of the Republic and sincere
                    good wishes for a happy and glorious administration.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Elihu Root</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
